	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Type `np` in Alfred to see the current Apple Music song with its sample rate and bit depth.

For streaming (Apple Music catalog) tracks the info is parsed from the system log via a background LaunchAgent; it auto-installs on first run and updates on every track change.

Enter copies a one-line summary to the clipboard.

Uninstall the watcher: run uninstall.sh from the workflow folder (Right-click → Open in Finder).</string>
